# Repulsor Blast: "Teamwork 2 ... deals 5 damage to target creature. If this spell was cast using teamwork, it also deals 2 damage to
# that creature's controller." On turn 3 Bot1 casts it with teamwork, tapping two Memnites (power 1 each, total 2), at Bot2's Aegis
# Turtle (0/5, so exactly 5 kills it): Bot2, its controller, loses 2 (18). On turn 5 a second one, again with teamwork, targets Bot1's
# own Aegis Turtle: its controller is Bot1, who loses 2 (18) - the damage goes to that creature's controller, not to the opponent.
# On turn 7 a third is cast without teamwork at Bot2's Fortress Crab (1/6, cast turn 4): it survives with exactly 5 damage, neither player loses life and the Memnites stay untapped.

